      "created_at": "2023-09-29T14:35:38Z",
      "updated_at": "2023-09-29T14:35:38Z",
      "body": "> but like banking apps that make your screenshot black when at some parts of the app\r\n\r\nHave you seen any banking *websites* which do this? After all this is a webapp and websites cannot blank your screen. Plus given its open source someone could again just modify and remove whatever hurdles you choose to add, or simply use a different Matrix client given there are hundreds.",
